SUMMARY:COMING THIS SUNDAY | An Evening with MJT
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, September 27  |  7 PM – 10 PM | From $13.32 Event Details and Tickets \nMJT is a musical force of nature and long-time fixture of Long Island’s live music scene in the Rock\, Progressive Alt Rock Genre. The Godfrey Brothers’ musical trifecta is built on Matt’s ambidextrous virtuosity\, playing simultaneous keyboards and synth bass\, Jordan’s bombastic edge-of-your-seat drumming along with David’s atmospheric chord melody guitar parts and soulful vocals. The Godfrey Brothers’ magic has captivated audiences opening for Slash & Myles Kennedy\, Alter Bridge and Sevendust while also backing diverse national touring acts like Yellowman\, Stone Bwoy and Tash Neal. mjttheband.com \nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-this-sunday-an-evening-with-mjt/2026-09-25/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/9_27_26_MJT_ONE-WORLD-WEST_ASHEVILLE_NC_1080x1350-1-e1787675932495.png
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
