UID:10087896-1790305200-1790391599@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING FRIDAY OCTOBER 9th | Trombone Shorty & Orleans Avenue w/ Abraham Alexander
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, October 9 | Amphitheater Stage | 6 PM DOORS | 7PM SHOW | From $51.50 Event Details and Tickets \nFew artists embody the heart and soul of their city like Trombone Shorty. Perhaps the most recognizable ambassador for New Orleans music working today\, Shorty has spent his entire life not only carrying the torch for Crescent City culture\, but also propelling it forward into the 21st century with his ecstatic live performances and intoxicating blend of rock\, funk\, soul\, jazz\, blues\, hip-hop\, and Caribbean influences. \nOn top of his relentless touring schedule\, Shorty also managed to launch The Trombone Shorty Foundation in 2011\, which supports youth music education in New Orleans and beyond. \nAcademy Award® nominated artist Abraham Alexander is a rising singer songwriter whose soulful fusion of blues\, folk\, and gospel has captivated audiences around the world. Born in Athens\, Greece to Nigerian parents and raised in Fort Worth\, Texas\, Alexander turned to music following a career ending soccer injury and personal tragedy. He released his breakout self-titled EP in 2019\, earning attention for his emotional storytelling and powerful vocal presence. With his powerful presence and genre-defying sound\, he continues to emerge as one of the most vital and visionary voices in contemporary music. \nSierra Nevada Brewing Co. is one of America’s premier craft breweries\, highly regarded for using only the finest quality ingredients.  Sierra Nevada has set the standard for craft brewers worldwide with innovations in the brewhouse as well as advances in sustainability. The view from our tree-lined brewery is something special no matter the season. Tour the brewhouse\, feast in the Taproom or soak in the sun on our Back Porch with a beer\, including the legendary Pale Ale and a snack. For our upcoming event line-up click here! \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-friday-october-9th-trombone-shorty-orleans-avenue-w-abraham-alexander/2026-09-25/
LOCATION:Sierra Nevada Mills River\, 100 Sierra Nevada Way\, Mills River\, NC\, 28732
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Mills River
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/753150555_1372172278342370_7442370875372319522_n-e1786642983575.jpg
GEO:35.4308568;-82.5535594
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Sierra Nevada Mills River 100 Sierra Nevada Way Mills River NC 28732;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=100 Sierra Nevada Way:geo:-82.5535594,35.4308568
END:VEVENT
