CREATED:20260718T190144Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T101533Z
UID:10080222-1790422200-1790433000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Jazz Brunch w/ “Four Peanuts” trio
DESCRIPTION:Jazz Brunch is now officially on the schedule for every Saturday here in the taproom! We’re so very excited to introduce our newest free weekly event\, open to all ages\, family & pet-friendly\n\n\n\n\nWe’ll have an extra special brunch menu\, craft beer\, mimosas\, and of course\, beer-mosas\, all alongside jazz music from the talented jazz fusion trio\, “Four Peanuts”. The group explores both original compositions and zesty covers of tunes you may or may not know. The trio features Alex Taub on keyboards\, Brennan Dugan on bass\, and Joe Enright on drums\, and will certainly leave your peanuts salted and boiled to perfection.\n\n\n\nJazz Brunch will take place every Saturday at French Broad River Brewery\, with a special brunch menu from @frenchbroadriverpizza🍕 \nIt is our hope that many of our community and new friends may join us in making Saturday dayzzz special here in the taproom this spring☀️ Cheers! \n\n\n  \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jazz-brunch-w-four-peanuts-trio-2-2-2-2/2026-09-26/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/IMG_5036-e1777019740232.jpeg
GEO:35.5662722;-82.5374054
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=French Broad River Brewery 101 Fairview Rd Asheville NC United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=101 Fairview Rd:geo:-82.5374054,35.5662722
END:VEVENT
