SUMMARY:Blue Ridge Pride Festival
DESCRIPTION:Blue Ridge Pride will host its traditional full day of live music\, magical performances\, and festival fun for the whole family beginning at noon and running all day until 6 PM in Pack Square Park. Guests will be able to visit over 200 tents offering locally made art\, games\, handcrafted gifts\, and a wide variety of food and drink. There will be local charities ready with valuable community resources and giveaways\, free health and wellness opportunities\, and many ways to connect with local business and community leaders. \nSaturday Main Stage Performers for Blue Ridge Pride 2026! \n12:00pm | The Asheville Gay Men’s Chorus\n12:40pm | Sal Landers\n1:20pm | Brennan Page\n2:00pm | Steppin Out AVL\n2:40pm | Max Ringenbach\n3:20pm | Anne Coombs & Company Swing\n4:00pm | Matinee Drag Show\n4:40pm | Carolina Down Boys\n5:20pm | Legendary Drag Show
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/blue-ridge-pride-festival-2025/
LOCATION:Pack Square Park
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
END:VEVENT
